    "title": "Wolf, Wenzel Score Hat Tricks as Columbus Catholic Blanks Adams-Friendship, 13-0 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Steven Okonek ,\n13 hours ago Elijah Wolf scored three goals and added two assists, Daxtyn Wenzel put in a hat trick of his own, and Columbus Catholic opened its season in emphatic fashion with a 13–0 shutout of Adams-Friendship. The Dons put the game away before halftime and never looked back, outshooting the opposition 37–0 and putting 25 of those attempts on goal. Read full article",
